<title>BELGIUM: GBL's Frere says thinks about retiring.</title>
<headline>GBL's Frere says thinks about retiring.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian financier Albert Frere, chairman of Belgian holding company Electrafina and head of group GBL, told Electrafina shareholders on Tuesday he was considering retiring.</p>
<p>&quot;One day I too will have to think about retiring,&quot; he said in an answer to a question at the annual shareholders' meeting.</p>
<p>Frere is now 71.</p>
</text>
